---
description: Apply Luphra design and motion skills when editing the book UI
globs: book/**/*.{html,css,js}
alwaysApply: false
---

Read `.agents/skills/emil-design-eng/SKILL.md` before changing motion or UI polish.

- Use `--ease-out` and `--duration-ui` / `--duration-press` from `book/styles.css`
- Buttons: `:active { transform: scale(0.97) }` at 160ms ease-out
- Entrances start at `scale(0.95–0.98)` + `opacity: 0`, never `scale(0)`
- Do not animate search, ⌘K focus, or sidebar navigation
- Quote reveals are once-per-element scroll fades, 220ms, transform + opacity only
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`
